title: other changes
pid: 6f2af2f7-705e-485d-be71-107611036151
body: |2-
  What a node's files changed that no other change-forest leaf records,
  all of it one leaf of the node, drawn as one change viewnode
  ('(otherChanges KIND...)'): its text moved between a private and a
  public section, its attribution changed, an alias moved to another
  skgrepo, one of its lists was reordered, or something else in its file
  changed. Its herald names each in those words, and its body shows the
  old order of a reordered list against the new. Its mark covers the
  state it was made on: a later change of the same kind unmarks it
  ('docs/diff-view.org', "Other changes to a node's file").
